   221	      CON-RTN.
   222            DISPLAY 'Input Another Record? (Y/N): ' LINE 19 COLUMN 26.
   223		  ACCEPT ANOTHER LINE 19 COLUMN 55.
   224            IF ANOTHER = 'Y' OR ANOTHER = 'y'
   225		  MOVE 0 TO EOFSW
   226		  MOVE SPACES TO REM
   227		      ELSE
   228                IF ANOTHER = 'N' OR ANOTHER = 'n'
   229		      MOVE 1 TO EOFSW
   230			ELSE
   231                  DISPLAY 'Y or N only!' LINE 18 COLUMN 32
   232			GO TO CON-RTN
   233		     END-IF
   234		  END-IF.
