   244
   245            DISPLAY 'School with Largest' LINE 24 COLUMN 10
   246            DISPLAY 'no. of Passed: ' LINE 24 COLUMN 30.
   247		  MOVE UP-PASSED TO MAX-PASSED
   248            MOVE 'UP' TO LARPAS
   249		  IF PUP-PASSED > MAX-PASSED
   250		  MOVE PUP-PASSED TO MAX-PASSED
   251            MOVE 'PUP' TO LARPAS
   252		  END-IF
   253
   254		  IF DLSU-PASSED > MAX-PASSED
   255		  MOVE DLSU-PASSED TO MAX-PASSED
   256            MOVE 'DLSU' TO LARPAS
   257		  END-IF
   258
   259		  IF ADMU-PASSED > MAX-PASSED
   260		  MOVE ADMU-PASSED TO MAX-PASSED
   261            MOVE 'ADMU' TO LARPAS
   262		  END-IF
   263
   264		  IF MAPUA-PASSED > MAX-PASSED
   265		  MOVE MAPUA-PASSED TO MAX-PASSED
   266            MOVE 'MAPUA' TO LARPAS
   267		  END-IF
